    n_action -->|Cần xác minh| n_verify
    n_sendRefund --> n_refundResponse
    n_refundResponse --> n_refundOk
    n_refundOk -->|Có| n_refundRecord
    n_refundOk -->|Không| n_verify
    n_refundRecord --> n_close
    n_uncoll --> n_close
    n_replacement --> n_close
    n_codRefund --> n_close
    n_verify --> n_pending
    n_close --> n_end
